sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant F as Frontend (Dashboard)
    participant A as Laravel API
    participant DB as Database
    U->>F: Click "Download configuration"
    F->>A: GET /api/vpn/config
    A->>A: Check active access + verified e-mail + gateway configured
    A->>DB: issueFor() - reuse or create a keypair + tunnel address
    A->>A: Build nexusvpn.conf ([Interface] + [Peer])
    A->>DB: audit vpn.config_downloaded
    A-->>F: .conf file (Cache-Control: no-store)
    F-->>U: WireGuard file download
